From a4fae0f1670a0b8c86ecf535650a107d8cc39535 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:10:54 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] =?UTF-8?q?v2.3.0:=20zamonaviy=20UI,=20500=20MB=20vide?=
 =?UTF-8?q?o/audio=20tahlili,=20Podkast=20=E2=86=92=20klip=20studiyasi?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Interfeys (zamonaviy AI ilovalar darajasida)
- AI javoblari pufakchasiz, to'liq kenglikda; holat satri ("O'ylayapman…",
  "Video qayta ishlanmoqda…") va miltillovchi kursor
- Kod bloklari: sintaksis ranglari (rehype-highlight, dark/light palitra),
  nusxa va fayl sifatida yuklab olish
- Yozish qatori: bir nechta biriktirma (chiplar, rasm/video ko'rinishi,
  yuklanish foizi), "/" buyruq avtoto'ldirish (Tab/Enter/↑↓), sudrab tashlash
  (butun sahifa), Ctrl+V bilan fayl, zamonaviy yuborish tugmasi
- Davom-savol tugmalari: model yashirin [[TAKLIF: …]] teglar yozadi, veb'da
  chip, Telegram'da reply keyboard
- Rasm lightbox, "pastga" tugmasi, xabar animatsiyalari
- Yon panel: suhbatlar sana bo'yicha (Qadalgan/Bugun/Kecha/7 kun/30 kun),
  qadash, qayta nomlash (ikki marta bosish), Ctrl+Shift+O, Esc — to'xtatish
- Boshlanish ekrani: kun vaqtiga qarab salom, imkoniyat kartalari, Podkast→klip
- Admin panel: yopishqoq sarlavha + bo'limlar navigatsiyasi, 4 ta stat
  (jami, onlayn, bugun faol, bugun yangi), to'lov so'rovlari soni
- Dizayn tokenlari (--tg-gold/--tg-teal/soyalar), umumiy tugma sinflari

Katta fayllar: video, audio, 500 MB gacha
- /api/upload — @vercel/blob client upload (brauzerdan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri,
  serverdan o'tmaydi; multipart >10 MB; foydalanuvchi papkasi; 500 MB)
- _lib/attachments.js — bitta joyda: kichik fayl inline, video/audio/katta
  fayl Gemini Files API (uri, ACTIVE kutish, Redis kesh 40 soat); PDF matn
  yoki skanerlangan bo'lsa hujjat sifatida; DOCX/XLSX/matn → matn
- Interactions API input: {type:'video'|'audio'|'image'|'document'}
- /api/chat maxDuration 300, 'status' SSE hodisalari, 6 tagacha fayl
- Eski (2.2 gacha) image/pdf/document maydonlari mosligi saqlandi

Podkast → klip (Opus Clip kabi)
- /klip sahifa: fayl (Blob) yoki YouTube/Instagram/TikTok havola; klip soni
  (1–8), uzunlik (30s–2 daqiqa), 9:16/1:1/16:9, til, so'zma-so'z subtitr,
  brend/pul izohlari, AI'ga ko'rsatma; jarayon foizi; natija kartalari
  (video, hook, yuklab olish, matn nusxasi); localStorage'da davom etadi
- /api/clips (submit/status, tarif tekshiruvi CLIPS_ALLOWED_PLANS, limit),
  /api/clips/file/[job]/[name] (Range bilan oqim), /api/clips/callback
- Telegram: /klip <havola> — tayyor kliplar chatga video bo'lib keladi
- local-worker: /clips/submit|status|file|cancel — yt-dlp yuklab olish,
  faster-whisper (word timestamps, VAD), Gemini hook tanlash (fallback:
  so'z zichligi), ffmpeg: kesish, crop/scale, ASS subtitr (aytilayotgan so'z
  oltin), hook sarlavha (oltin quti), brend/pul izohlari (teal quti),
  thumbnail, TTL tozalash, callback. Linux'da to'liq oqim sinaldi
  (whisper tiny + TTS audio → klip + callback)

Boshqa
- Telegram: markdown havolalar, sendTelegramVideo
- Versiya 2.3.0 + CHANGELOG, README, .env.example (BLOB, CLIPS_*),
  @vercel/blob, rehype-highlight, highlight.js

