Interfeys
- BrandMark: harakatlanuvchi logotip (konus halqa, qarama-qarshi orbita, nur, puls) —
  splash, kirish, boshlanish, header, yon panel, AI avatari (o'ylayotganda tezlashadi),
  yuklanish; oqayotgan gradient nom; aurora fon; brend uslubidagi 404/xato/loading
- Fikrlash bloki (thinking summaries), manbalar chiplari (url_citation), e'lon banneri
  (admin'dan), suhbatga avtomatik nom (/api/title), PWA shortcuts + share_target

AI / backend (xatosiz ishlash)
- withRetry: 429/5xx/tarmoqda qayta urinish, model topilmasa standart modelga,
  vositalar xato bersa ularsiz, eski ip eskirsa usiz; friendlyAiError; qisman javob saqlanadi
- Avtomatik vositalar: google_search + url_context (AUTO_TOOLS_PLANS), thinking_summaries,
  max_output_tokens 8192; Telegram va ovozli rejim ham retry/tools bilan
- Texnik ishlar rejimi va funksiya tugmachalari (settings) chat/Telegram/klip/video/rasmda
- Telemetriya (recordEvent) barcha kanallarda — faqat sonlar

Fayllar: GB'lab
- 5 GB gacha (multipart), video/audio/katta fayl Blob'dan Gemini'ga OQIM bilan
  (resumable upload, duplex, xotirasiz — 120 MB test); AI chegarasi 2 GB; admin chegarasi

Podkast → klip (worker)
- NVENC/libx264 (fast|high|max, crf 18 standart), lanczos, fps saqlanadi, loudnorm, 192k/48k
- Pauzalarni avtomatik kesish (jump-cut) — audio balandligi bo'yicha aniq, subtitr/sarlavha
  vaqtlari qayta xaritalanadi; removed_pause_seconds
- Yuzga qarab kadrlash (OpenCV Haar/YuNet), ikki so'zlovchi — bo'lingan ekran (layout auto/single/split)
- clip_count 0 = avtomatik; manba 8 GB; transkripsiya progressi/ETA; Gemini retry;
  bitta klip xatosi butun ishni to'xtatmaydi (warnings); callback'da warnings
- /klip sahifa: avtomatik soni, aqlli montaj tugmachalari, sifat, eslatmalar; Telegram /klip ham

Admin panel — serverdan jonli
- Tizim holati (Gemini, Redis, Blob, worker, Telegram webhook, auth, push, cron)
- AI foydalanish (kunlik, kanal/tur/model, xatolar %, javob vaqti, top foydalanuvchilar)
- Oxirgi xatolar jurnali; Ilova sozlamalari (e'lon, texnik ishlar, funksiyalar, chegara)
- _lib/stats.js, _lib/settings.js, /api/admin/health|usage|errors|settings, /api/settings

Metadata
- 17 sahifa uchun title/description/OG/Twitter/robots layout'lari, dinamik opengraph-image
  va twitter-image (1200×630, brend), boyitilgan root metadata va manifest

